{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0824c247bbf3a1f00ba5a494b9da4b7a8b08ae83c1e76d5990a0afd371842319", "ja": "（琴葉の新しい衣装が届いた。ヤンデレが\nイメージというなかなか尖ったタイプの衣装だが……）", "zh": "（琴叶的新衣服送到了。这是一套以病娇为主题、风格相当大胆的服装，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1001_p", "source_sha256": "881bdb246d233a4d0df18f97b4086d9e317ff0c13bb53e61daccac0415cef744", "ja": "琴葉、お疲れさま。\nさっそく着てみてくれたみたいだけど、どうかな？", "zh": "琴叶，辛苦了。\n你已经迫不及待地试穿了啊，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "51d293204a19d0f844b9418c944debb0bfcc272a82fb18d31291a4aabff4042f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\n……そうですね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n……是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "ca9d41be995a9da9b98bd899f7e05d8efed8600f4ed836ac227f4ae6eb693ffd", "ja": "この衣装、{$P$}が、\n私だけのために用意してくれたんですよね？", "zh": "这套服装是{$P$}先生专门为我准备的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1004_p", "source_sha256": "90ea21ab2edb1c0cccf84db11595cb75639624823e16ac4e7aff6265f59f7f61", "ja": "あ、ああ、そうだけど……。\n琴葉？　なんか少し距離が近いような……。", "zh": "啊、啊，是这样没错……  \n琴叶？总觉得你是不是靠得有点太近了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "98e3260d4977bb40eeb9f67d1fc2f56a619b367bc35675529c6d7a015cf82939", "ja": "うふふ……だってこうすれば{$P$}の\n目には、私しか映らないでしょう？", "zh": "嘻嘻……因为这样的话，在{$P$}的眼里，就只看得到我了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "a4580a8a67289d1199293d61471551ee49b9ea28b8357e0774bd2414f8ffe797", "ja": "{$P$}を独り占めしたくて……。\n私のことだけ、見てて欲しいんです。", "zh": "想把{$P$}占为己有……\n我希望你只注视着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "6b5128c7ce5fad0300a639fab186687e0333b044fe5820fe16cdfac3bf461650", "ja": "似合ってますか？　似合ってるって言ってください。\n琴葉が一番可愛いよ、って……。", "zh": "适合我吗？请告诉我很适合……说“琴叶最可爱”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1aec6b771db6968a7fe378d76f37bce3596c2ce1c4c046ff290d3a63a26fb5f7", "ja": "こ、琴葉？\nなんだか今日は、いつもと雰囲気が……。", "zh": "琴、琴叶？\n总觉得今天的气氛……和往常不太一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "d67ebe4dcf797a1429f2c9e14f22b61bba8fdde5c23101de91ae1f45fb36d003", "ja": "ふふっ、ごめんなさい。\nちょっと、悪ふざけが過ぎちゃいましたね。", "zh": "呵呵，对不起。\n刚才有点玩笑开过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6f7e980dc9a210346a51baee1fe8ba244f7339431ed08b5b75336f1836221dde", "ja": "悪ふざけ？　……あ、もしかして今の、\n役作りの一環だったのかな？", "zh": "恶作剧？……啊，难道刚才那些，是为了塑造角色的一环吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "776dd3def65dda9743248c65e5f7d9b0fff001582831088296cb12988a4f33be", "ja": "はい。衣装を着たら、試してみたくなったんです。", "zh": "是的。穿上服装后，就忍不住想试试看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "1aab0796df406144bceb9710e6dcb8b735d735a17249b72890f5a3fece998c9c", "ja": "普段の私じゃ言えないようなことも、\nこの姿なら言えるんじゃないかって。", "zh": "平时的我说不出口的话，\n穿上这身打扮，或许就能说出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1013_p", "source_sha256": "64d1ef30afff9cb8cf7591d8099c2b9c7000a6690f07a5eb3347606d0a0c7400", "ja": "そうか……衣装がお芝居を後押ししたんだな。\nとはいえ、さっきは驚いたけど……。", "zh": "这样啊……是服装助推了你的演技啊。\n不过，刚才还是吓了我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "c0072fa8515ca8b79a83147d77c47cf8ce2de4a1cf82fe8c6bc3f2a80f86285b", "ja": "すみません。\nそんなに驚かせるつもりじゃなかったんですけど。", "zh": "对不起。\n我没打算让你那么吃惊的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "2fb5ed8e3fe264af905981f8799083f33604ebd1490a31de72b2fd2a6334dcf1", "ja": "もっと……普段から素直に言えてたら……。", "zh": "要是平时……能更坦率地说出来就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1016_p", "source_sha256": "402a5333214c1dacf7d3e3701ef709dceeb864a7ed99727094c396bf0efac1f1", "ja": "琴葉？", "zh": "琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "f30ec772dcc553afcf071b9c0c23b469033699c0ddfd3ca3fe1102c2e30ac885", "ja": "あ、なんでもないです。ただ、\n{$P$}に感謝しないとって。", "zh": "啊，没什么。只是觉得，必须感谢{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "f2a285ff331e7e85d2278e73ddd33ecc24ac87bf960f11d76cb5bb568df7c128", "ja": "私の可能性を、見つけてくれましたから。", "zh": "因为是你发现了我的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2aaa702aa2b80bc29f6bfe1a4130af796b9d9c35e2230bc4fa4c712e6bec5251", "ja": "そう言ってもらえて嬉しいよ。でも、演じる前には\n一言ほしいかな。テーマ的にも心の準備が……。", "zh": "能听你这么说，我很高兴。不过，在让我出演之前，还是希望你能先说一声。毕竟从主题上来说，也需要做些心理准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "b09a60e4f4c03a23dfe747e0caae0ca3e72634ee717dbbf4edebd1ffa08443b0", "ja": "迷惑ってこと……ですか？　なんで？　どうして？　\nあなたに見て欲しいだけなのに……ねえ、なんで！？", "zh": "是觉得我添麻烦了吗……？为什么？为什么？我只是想让你看看而已……呐，为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b61e8dc6b7e08c8fe0041c7eef1238a4e936ccf6788c977debdae20a84ac491a", "ja": "琴葉……からかってるな？", "zh": "琴叶……你是在捉弄我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "4e48f53d3ee5916ac32bc6707e4f1243fd7032e4b873d8c41e3b07dab82c2a2d", "ja": "ふふっ、すみません。お陰でコツが掴めました。\nお仕事がんばります！", "zh": "呵呵，不好意思。多亏了你，我已经掌握诀窍了。\n我会努力工作的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0504_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a0a1d89e433afbb1a29121cc01abf7ed536f7f581beaef20b4b6dab01a35221a", "ja": "（ヤンデレに対して、ここまでノリノリとは……。\n役作りも完璧だし、さすが琴葉だな！）", "zh": "（没想到她对病娇角色这么投入……角色塑造也完美，不愧是琴叶啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
